    <introduction><p>The diagram below shows the graph of a function <m>f</m> along with points <m>P</m> and <m>R</m>,
which lie on the graph. Point <m>Q</m> is chosen so that <m>\triangle PQR</m> is a right 
triangle. (Click on the graph to display a larger version.)</p>
